Sandbox Atlas answers the questions you would otherwise ask a senior teammate. Where does this feature live? What breaks if I change this file? What is the safest way to make this edit?

It indexes the project on install with no extra setup, builds the real import graph with ts-morph and shows it as an interactive map. Code stays on your machine unless you choose an online provider.
